{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/f682ec5374a1d182e5b88800a0398b1b.avif?t=1753426867\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/4851db25bce57c97e00ed5c5a98c0ef9.poster.avif?t=1753426867\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/4851db25bce57c97e00ed5c5a98c0ef9.webm?t=1753426867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/4851db25bce57c97e00ed5c5a98c0ef9.mp4?t=1753426867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/77a999cd8ca189754e27d227799ff67d.avif?t=1753426867\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast. Fierce. Frictionless.<br>Step into Rivals Hover League, the official vehicular combat sport spreading across the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a pilot, you\u2019ll take control of a hover vehicle, dominate the arena, grow with your team, and rise to legend.<br>Outplay your rival \u2014 Hover, Boost, Shoot Your Way to MVP!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/daf78b6a0c85540a481699cbd3528da2.poster.avif?t=1753426867\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/daf78b6a0c85540a481699cbd3528da2.webm?t=1753426867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/daf78b6a0c85540a481699cbd3528da2.mp4?t=1753426867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/9ca13b177f8f428dfb2ac58091062368.avif?t=1753426867\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forget the ground. Out here, motion never ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control your hover as it glides, drifts, and blasts through the arena with gravity-defying boosts, high-flying jumps, and precision braking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every vehicle feels like a real machine with weight, friction, and impact you can feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every shot, every turn, every second. It all starts at your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/d39e301b9d05a322c122be65df7e77ba.poster.avif?t=1753426867\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/d39e301b9d05a322c122be65df7e77ba.webm?t=1753426867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/d39e301b9d05a322c122be65df7e77ba.mp4?t=1753426867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/568f59a95bd7e3a5f1faf6007fd7366a.avif?t=1753426867\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Form a squad of up to four and enter the league.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can hover alone, but victory? That takes teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Coordinate with your crew, lock onto your rivals, and push through the chaos together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hover the arena together. Make the win yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/048224fdbd1cb95ce5e674263d6bdc5d.poster.avif?t=1753426867\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/048224fdbd1cb95ce5e674263d6bdc5d.webm?t=1753426867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/048224fdbd1cb95ce5e674263d6bdc5d.mp4?t=1753426867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/63e97a3cc96996b30bffa6c1154189d8.avif?t=1753426867\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slice through rivals with speed,<br>shield your team with brute force,<br>or disrupt the field with tactical tech.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select from unique hover classes, each designed with its own edge in combat.<br>The right Hover in the right hands? That\u2019s your competitive edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/1919109490047b42e37faa4c0544c549.poster.avif?t=1753426867\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/1919109490047b42e37faa4c0544c549.webm?t=1753426867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/1919109490047b42e37faa4c0544c549.mp4?t=1753426867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/1db2bd0dbfe0e7480ae9b8a5c9d8a68c.avif?t=1753426867\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rivals Hover League isn\u2019t built for just one way to win.<br>Each match brings different rules, objectives, and arenas. With them, new strategies and shifting team dynamics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adapt fast, play smart, and turn every game into your own kind of victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/5ee0403f364be5dbd686a90c858c05f3.poster.avif?t=1753426867\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/5ee0403f364be5dbd686a90c858c05f3.webm?t=1753426867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/5ee0403f364be5dbd686a90c858c05f3.mp4?t=1753426867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/97243dd545b89363dc94188e0251c307.avif?t=1753426867\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wishlist now and hop into our official Discord!<br>Chat with the devs, clash in pilot tournaments, and help shape the future of RHL, together with the community!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We're building RHL <i>with</i> you, one hover at a time!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3251280?t=1753426867","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/bc2f953e480fa0154f753b94555e3ba082813196/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753426867","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/762d144e2ebce6bb0a4358406ec132db97ae3064/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753426867","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/762d144e2ebce6bb0a4358406ec132db97ae3064/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753426867","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3779620,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Announcement of Demo Test</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/4d5e533fd0cfd3d14b90664a3c188c13.avif?t=1753426867\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The galaxy\u2019s wildest competition, Rivals Hover League, is gearing up for its grand debut, and the first playable demo is your chance to prove your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/e3d1156cdb1186ded78b8fb5834c015b.poster.avif?t=1753426867\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/e3d1156cdb1186ded78b8fb5834c015b.webm?t=1753426867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/e3d1156cdb1186ded78b8fb5834c015b.mp4?t=1753426867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this Demo, Experience the ultimate fusion of high-speed action, precision shooting, and strategic teamplay.<br>Experience the full thrill of fast-paced action, precise shooting, and strategic teamplay\u2014and don\u2019t miss the exclusive rewards for first demo participants!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For the latest updates on the demo, be sure to visit our official Discord!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/a67d020334578d1acc6cba18f815d867.avif?t=1753426867\" /></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/f682ec5374a1d182e5b88800a0398b1b.avif?t=1753426867\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/4851db25bce57c97e00ed5c5a98c0ef9.poster.avif?t=1753426867\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/4851db25bce57c97e00ed5c5a98c0ef9.webm?t=1753426867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/4851db25bce57c97e00ed5c5a98c0ef9.mp4?t=1753426867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/77a999cd8ca189754e27d227799ff67d.avif?t=1753426867\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast. Fierce. Frictionless.<br>Step into Rivals Hover League, the official vehicular combat sport spreading across the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a pilot, you\u2019ll take control of a hover vehicle, dominate the arena, grow with your team, and rise to legend.<br>Outplay your rival \u2014 Hover, Boost, Shoot Your Way to MVP!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/daf78b6a0c85540a481699cbd3528da2.poster.avif?t=1753426867\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/daf78b6a0c85540a481699cbd3528da2.webm?t=1753426867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/daf78b6a0c85540a481699cbd3528da2.mp4?t=1753426867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/9ca13b177f8f428dfb2ac58091062368.avif?t=1753426867\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forget the ground. Out here, motion never ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control your hover as it glides, drifts, and blasts through the arena with gravity-defying boosts, high-flying jumps, and precision braking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every vehicle feels like a real machine with weight, friction, and impact you can feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every shot, every turn, every second. It all starts at your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/d39e301b9d05a322c122be65df7e77ba.poster.avif?t=1753426867\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/d39e301b9d05a322c122be65df7e77ba.webm?t=1753426867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/d39e301b9d05a322c122be65df7e77ba.mp4?t=1753426867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/568f59a95bd7e3a5f1faf6007fd7366a.avif?t=1753426867\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Form a squad of up to four and enter the league.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can hover alone, but victory? That takes teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Coordinate with your crew, lock onto your rivals, and push through the chaos together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hover the arena together. Make the win yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/048224fdbd1cb95ce5e674263d6bdc5d.poster.avif?t=1753426867\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/048224fdbd1cb95ce5e674263d6bdc5d.webm?t=1753426867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/048224fdbd1cb95ce5e674263d6bdc5d.mp4?t=1753426867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/63e97a3cc96996b30bffa6c1154189d8.avif?t=1753426867\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slice through rivals with speed,<br>shield your team with brute force,<br>or disrupt the field with tactical tech.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select from unique hover classes, each designed with its own edge in combat.<br>The right Hover in the right hands? That\u2019s your competitive edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/1919109490047b42e37faa4c0544c549.poster.avif?t=1753426867\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/1919109490047b42e37faa4c0544c549.webm?t=1753426867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251280/extras/1919109490047b42e37faa4c0544c549.mp4?t=1753426867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"